  "id": "chronotherapy",
  "term": "chronotherapy",
  "definition": "Chronotherapy is the practice of timing medication to the body’s daily circadian rhythms so it matches when a drug’s target varies across the day. The aim is to improve treatment effects while reducing side effects and unwanted drug interactions.",
